<string_table>
  <string id="st_player_skills_hint_bartering">
    <text>Improves prices when trading.\n \nGain experience by buying or selling items.\n \n</text>
  </string>
  <string id="st_player_skills_hint_insanity">
    <text>You lose your sanity, but gain psi regeneration and resistance.\nPlaying an instrument doubles psi regeneration.\n \nGain experience from psi damage or playing during combat.\n \n</text>
  </string>
  <string id="st_player_skills_hint_lockpicking">
    <text>Reduces the difficulty of picking locked containers.\n \nGain experience by opening containers.\n(Using the Skeleton Key grants no experience.)\n \n</text>
  </string>
  <string id="st_player_skills_hint_magloading">
    <text>Increases magazine loading and unloading speed.\n \nGain experience by loading or unloading magazines.\nMaximum level is limited by Strength and Endurance.\n \n</text>
  </string>
  <string id="st_player_skills_hint_medicine">
    <text>Temporarily improves health recovery and radiation removal, depending on the medicine used.\n \nGain experience by using medical supplies.\n \n</text>
  </string>
  <string id="st_player_skills_hint_reloading">
    <text>Increases reload and weapon draw speed.\n \nNormal weapon use grants experience.\nMaximum level is limited by Endurance and Survival.\n \n</text>
  </string>
  <string id="st_player_skills_hint_tinkering">
    <text>Increases the chance not to consume a repair item when fixing equipment.\n \nGain experience by repairing equipment with repair supplies.\n \n</text>
  </string>
